Database schema migrations for the application persistence database.

Common commands:

- python -m back.infrastructure.persistence.migration_gate upgrade
- python -m back.infrastructure.persistence.migration_gate verify
- alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
- alembic current
- alembic history --verbose

Never stamp an existing unversioned database as head. Back it up, restore an
isolated clone, compare it with a fresh migrated schema, and implement the
reviewed adoption migration described in docs/refactor/19-database-cleanup-plan.md.
